UPSTREAM SOURCES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files in data/raw/ are unmodified copies of public records published by third
parties and are not covered by the licences above:

  - Chicago Public Schools — Space Utilization Data (SY2026), School Profile
    Information API. Published by CPS.
  - City of Chicago Data Portal — School Locations SY2526 (pb6d-zzuh),
    Boundaries: Community Areas (igwz-8jzy). Published by the City of Chicago
    under its Terms of Use.

Their terms govern their reuse. Retained here, dated and unaltered, so that
published figures remain reproducible after upstream revision.
